* [HIP] tune(moe): retune qwen3.5 397b fp4 fmoe small-M decode rows

M=4/8/16 recover the 1-stage flat MXfp4 kernel (fmoe_bf16_pertokenMXfp4_g1u1_
flat_novs_silu_16x128E/16x256E) over the slower 2-stage path, and M=32 moves
to the faster t32x64x256_w3 stage-1. All referenced kernels already ship in
aiter.

